        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST**\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present a lovely DOUBLE ROOM to rent on Dromcarra Avenue, Tallaght, at 750 per room.\nThe room is in a 3-Bed Semi-Detached House. The property comprises of an entranceway, an open plan kitchen/dining area, a main bathroom, a large outdoor area to the rear, and a driveway for 2 cars.\nIn terms of location, Dromcarra Avenue is conveniently located close to all amenities, The Square Shopping Centre and Tallaght Hospital to name a few. There are also a number of public transport options available that will bring you in and out of the City Centre and surrounding areas.\nKey Features:\n•Spacious Double Room\n•Outdoor Area to the rear\n•Sought-after Location\n•Parking\n•Various Transport Links\nAVAILABLE END OF MAY!\n**RAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE*\nFILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**\n"
